    "title": "DINO Building Damage",
    "description": "Frozen DINOv3-ViT-L/16 (SAT-493M) siamese encoder with a UperNet decoder that grades each building footprint as no damage, minor damage, major damage or destroyed by comparing pre-event and post-event RGB imagery. The decoder and heads were trained on the xBD (xView2) building damage dataset. Footprints come from OpenStreetMap or from a GeoJSON passed at prediction time. By default (strict_head), fine-tuning adapts only the localization and damage heads to the labelled buildings of one event.",
